// greeter.ct — 最小可运行示例：一个 trait、一个 struct、一次实现、两个调用
// 展开规则见 docs/language-spec.md；运行方式见 examples/../README.md
// License: MIT; see LICENSE.EXCEPTION (free to copy into your own project)
#include <stdio.h>
#include <stdlib.h>

trait Greeter {
    void greet();
    void greet_name(char *name);
}

struct Person {
    char *name;
    int age;
} use Greeter;

impl Greeter for Person {
    void greet() {
        printf("Hello, I'm %s, age %d\n", self->name, self->age);
    }
    void greet_name(char *name) {
        printf("Hello %s, I'm %s\n", name, self->name);
    }
}

int main() {
    Person p = { .name = "Tom", .age = 36 };
    p.greet();
    p.greet_name("Jerry");
    return 0;
}
